# Claude Code — workshop-app

## Entry

Read `CLAUDE.md` and `AGENTS.md` in this folder.

## sbx sandbox

```bash
sbx secret set -g anthropic          # host keychain — never in repo
sbx run claude workshop-app/ --name feature/<name>
# Or clone mode for isolated Git work:
sbx run --clone claude workshop-app/ --name feature/<name>
```

Credentials stay on host (proxy-managed inside VM). Use `--clone` for isolated Git work.

## Code standards

- Server Components by default; `"use client"` only for forms/interactivity
- `"use server"` files: **async functions only** — types in separate `*.types.ts`
- Validate all `FormData` in Server Actions with Zod
- Workshop strings → `src/lib/workshop-data.ts`

## Do not

- Paste API keys, Supabase service role, or `.env.local` into commits
- Add dependencies without strong reason
- Break Apple theme tokens in `globals.css`

## Ship check

`npm run build && npm run lint` from `workshop-app/`
